7. Hirschhorn shows the residue-6 monomial sum `P` (after the 7th-power expansion)
   is a `Z`-linear combination of these 5 relations with explicit multipliers
   `a = 7, b = 5, c = 7`.  Hence `P ≡ 0 (mod 11)`.

